        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Community Events Tonight — Display Pipeline</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\" />\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <header class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h1>Community Events Tonight</h1>\n      <p class=\"sub\">See events that match the current filters.</p>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"container pills\">\n    <p id=\"countMessage\" class=\"pill\"></p>\n    <p id=\"filterLabel\" class=\"pill pill-muted\"></p>\n  </section>\n\n  <main class=\"container\">\n    <ul id=\"eventList\" class=\"grid\" aria-label=\"Matching events\"></ul>\n    <p id=\"emptyMessage\" class=\"empty\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n  </main>\n\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "/* Layout & type (plain CSS) */\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  color: #1f2937;\n  background: #f3f4f6;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n.container { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px; }\n\n/* Header */\n.header { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #eef2ff 100%); border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; }\n.header h1 { margin: 10px 0 6px; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; }\n.sub { margin: 0; color: #6b7280; }\n\n/* Transparency pills */\n.pills { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 8px; }\n.pill {\n  display: inline-block;\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  padding: 8px 14px;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n.pill-muted { color: #6b7280; font-style: italic; }\n\n/* Card grid */\n.grid {\n  list-style: none;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 14px 0 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n.card {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  padding: 14px;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n  transition: transform .12s ease, box-shadow .12s ease;\n}\n.card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }\n.card h3 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 18px; }\n\n/* Badges */\n.badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }\n.badge {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 3px 8px;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: .2px;\n  background: #eef2ff;\n  color: #3730a3;\n  border: 1px solid #c7d2fe;\n}\n.badge.gray { background: #f3f4f6; color: #374151; border-color: #e5e7eb; }\n.badge.green { background: #ecfdf5; color: #065f46; border-color: #a7f3d0; }\n\n/* Empty state */\n.empty {\n  margin-top: 16px;\n  color: #6b7280;\n  font-style: italic;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px dashed #e5e7eb;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n}\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// READ: source data + rule\nconst events = [\n  { title: \"Open Mic Night\",     category: \"Arts\",   start: \"6:30 PM\", free: true,  venue: \"River Hall\" },\n  { title: \"Youth Basketball\",   category: \"Sports\", start: \"4:00 PM\", free: false, venue: \"Rec Center\" },\n  { title: \"Book Club\",          category: \"Books\",  start: \"7:15 PM\", free: true,  venue: \"Library\" },\n  { title: \"Food Truck Friday\",  category: \"Food\",   start: \"5:30 PM\", free: false, venue: \"Market Square\" },\n  { title: \"Coding Meetup\",      category: \"Tech\",   start: \"8:00 PM\", free: true,  venue: \"Innovation Hub\" }\n];\n\nconst render = () => {\n  const list = document.getElementById(\"eventList\");\n  const countMsg = document.getElementById(\"countMessage\");\n  const label = document.getElementById(\"filterLabel\");\n  const empty = document.getElementById(\"emptyMessage\");\n\n\n\n\n  \n};\n\nrender();\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "1",
        "2",
        "3"
      ]
    },
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Community Events Tonight\r\n\r\n**Goal:**\r\nBuild a simple **read → transform → render** pipeline that displays local events. Add clear feedback cues so users always know how many events match and what filters are applied.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n1. **Open `script.js`.**\r\n   Find the `render()` function. This is where the event list is built.\r\n\r\n2. **Implement the pipeline:**\r\n\r\n   * **Read:** Use the `events` array and the filter rule (e.g. after 5:00 PM, free only).\r\n   * **Transform:** Use a loop to create a `results` list with only the events that match both conditions.\r\n   * **Render:** Use another loop to display those results as list items on the page.\r\n\r\n3. **Add transparency cues:**\r\n\r\n   * **Count message:**\r\n     Update `#countMessage` to show how many results are displayed out of the total.\r\n\r\n   * **Filter label:**\r\n     Update `#filterLabel` to summarize the current rule.\r\n\r\n   * **Empty-state message:**\r\n     If no events match, display an friendly empty-state message.\r\n\r\n\r\n4. **Test your work.**\r\n\r\n\r\n5. **Use AI to check your reasoning.**\r\n\r\n   * \"Explain what my loop is doing in the transform step.\"\r\n   * \"Is my count message still correct when no events match?\"\r\n   * \"Suggest a friendlier empty-state message.\"",
